  volume   =  43,
  number   =  12,
  pages    = "1638--1646",
  abstract = "Payments to Medicare Advantage (MA) plans are adjusted by a
              risk-score model that is calibrated on diagnostic and demographic
              data from traditional Medicare beneficiaries and then applied to
              MA beneficiaries. If MA plans capture more diagnostic codes than
              traditional Medicare, they receive payment that is higher than the
